Section name: Experiments
Excerpt:
In this section, we empirically validate the theoretical results of the proposed HENN structure and assess the algorithms developed for its construction. Furthermore, we implement the general HENN graph within the widely used Faiss library [ 17,35], providing it as a new index alongside the existing popular ANN indices. The code is publicly available at this anonymous repository. Additional experi- mental results are provided in Appendix E due to space constraints. We organize the experiments into the following parts: (1)Experiments Setup. Description of datasets (both real and syn- thetic), baseline methods, evaluation metrics, and configuration details. (2)Proximity Graph Integration. Integration of different prox- imity graphs into the HENN framework and evaluation of their performance. (3)Verification of Time Guarantees. Empirical validation of the time bounds proved in Section 4. (4

